{"by":"alex_artamokhov","id":50223414,"parent":50205750,"text":"&gt;&gt;What happens if the MCP server changes its tools more than once a day? we lost the state between polls<p>&gt;&gt;Will all those changes be logged? no, histor not fix every intermediate change, servers polles once a day<p>23,821 it&#x27;s a number of detected changes, not total.<p>thank you for pointing this, first I&#x27;ll separate server checks from the packages, then make more frequent checks for servers that change often","time":1792863643,"type":"comment"}